<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Anglo Irish Bank sees sustained growth.</title>
<headline>Anglo Irish Bank sees sustained growth.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo Irish Bank Corporation plc said a strong financial performance and market position would enable it to sustain growth to the year's end.</p>
<p>The bank reported a 22 percent increase in pre-tax profits to 13.7 million Irish pounds in the six months to March 31 and a 23 percent increase in earnings per share to 4.23 pence.</p>
</text>
